cing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Garik Shmois","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/advanced-drainage-wms-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WMS 2026 Q4","e":"wms","d":"2026-05-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Donald Scott Barbour","x":"Agriculture sales increased 30% in the quarter as customers bought ahead of price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/wms-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WMS 2026 Q4","e":"wms","d":"2026-05-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Donald Scott Barbour","x":"Demand is very choppy, with order patterns shifting as customers try to get orders in ahead of price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/wms-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WMS 2027 Q1","e":"wms","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"D. Barbour","x":"We estimate there was approximately $25 million to $30 million of revenue pulled into the first quarter from the second as customers try to get ahead of price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/ads-wms-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WMS 2027 Q1","e":"wms","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Cottrill","x":"…market; the $25 million to $30 million pull-ahead from customers trying to buy ahead of price increases as well as good execution on our commercial strategies, including the timing benefit realized from implementing pricing actions ahead of higher material costs. Moving to cash flow.…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/ads-wms-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WMS 2027 Q1","e":"wms","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Halloran","x":"Maybe just kind of cadence, how you're thinking about what the steps look like in the short term on the any kind of facility work or restructuring work or internal improvement work that you're doing, both kind of this year and then into next year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/ads-wms-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WMS 2027 Q2","e":"wms","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Cottrill","x":"You may recall from our first quarter call, we estimated approximately $30 million-$40 million that was pulled, $25 million-$30 million that was pulled into the first quarter from the second quarter due to the timing of price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/ads-wms-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WMS 2027 Q2","e":"wms","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"David Tarantino","x":"I assume most of your plastic and concrete competitors are having to raise prices maybe even more so than you are, given you own your transportation fleet, et cetera.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/ads-wms-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[33,1,5216,0,0,0,4167,744],[36,1,5857,0,0,0,4731,751],[37,1,6839,0,0,0,5934,590],[38,1,6381,0,0,0,5570,547],[39,1,4848,0,0,0,4607,0],[40,1,6201,0,0,0,4974,907],[41,1,6487,0,0,0,5270,926],[42,1,5076,0,0,0,4247,541],[43,1,7439,0,0,0,6160,891],[44,1,5909,0,0,0,4726,862],[45,1,5748,0,0,0,4656,802],[46,1,5766,0,0,0,4290,1135],[47,1,4469,0,0,0,3483,718],[63,1,3744,0,0,0,2567,0],[64,1,7083,0,0,0,4956,1780],[65,1,8621,0,0,0,7705,0],[66,1,7999,0,0,0,5575,2043],[67,1,7175,0,0,0,1821,4789]],"cinema":[[33,1,5216,0,0,0,4167,744],[36,1,5857,0,0,0,4731,751],[37,1,6839,0,0,0,5934,590],[38,1,6381,0,0,0,5570,547],[39,1,4848,0,0,0,4607,0],[40,1,6201,0,0,0,4974,907],[41,1,6487,0,0,0,5270,926],[42,1,5076,0,0,0,4247,541],[43,1,7439,0,0,0,6160,891],[44,1,5909,0,0,0,4726,862],[45,1,5748,0,0,0,4656,802],[46,1,5766,0,0,0,4290,1135],[47,1,4469,0,0,0,3483,718],[63,1,3744,0,0,0,2567,0],[64,1,7083,0,0,0,4956,1780],[65,1,8621,0,0,0,7705,0],[66,1,7999,0,0,0,5575,2043],[67,